  "steps": [
    "To a blender add 100g low-fat paneer, 2 cloves garlic, 3 tbsp Greek yogurt, 1 tsp chilli flakes, 2 dried red chillies, 10ml lemon juice (juice of half a lime), 1 tsp salt.",
    "Blend until smooth and creamy, then set it aside.",
    "Now to a bowl add: 1 tbsp chopped onions, 1 tbsp grated carrots, 1 tbsp grated cucumber, 1 tbsp chopped coriander leaves.",
    "Pour in the paneer sauce and mix everything together. Your creamy paneer filling is ready!",
    "Now take 2 slices of multigrain bread.",
    "Spread half the filling onto the bread and close the sandwich.",
    "Toast it with 1 tsp butter until golden and crispy on both sides."
  ],
